# Ammo store: banks MUNITIONS ("Ammo store capacity"); workers fill it from the Ammo works and take from it to the
# Cannons (a storage of the munitions good). DESTROYED WITH MUNITIONS INSIDE IT EXPLODES (StructureSystem::ammoBlast):
# keep it away from the wall. A 2x1.5x2 m box (1 cell). Spawned origin 0.75 above the ground.
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a low iron-banded crate (the root) with a stack of
# pale charging crystals on it. The child pieces are render-only.
